  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supp National assembly to be more effective ,tranparent &amp; inclusive using National Implementation Modality (NIM)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the project is to support the NA to be more effective, transparent and inclusive. This proposed support focuses on enabling a responsible closure of the project by facilitating the implementation of a set of priority activities that enhance the sustainability of the project results, and generate lessons that are likely to inform future phases of the project.The Embassy engages with the project through bilateral and joint partnership meetings, and participation in the project board.</narrative>
  </description>
